# Normalise the repository on LF.
#
# History previously diverged purely by line endings (a CRLF-checked-in copy and
# an LF one), producing commits with identical content but different hashes.
# Pinning eol=lf stops that recurring, and Streamlit Community Cloud runs Linux,
# so LF is the natural target.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads must never be line-ending converted.
*.npz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz binary
*.parquet binary
